@startuml
title US11 - Relevant Domain Model Excerpt\nDomain Model (DM)

left to right direction
hide methods
hide circle
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classBorderColor #2563EB
skinparam classBackgroundColor #EFF6FF
skinparam ArrowColor #475569

class Administrator

class Parameter {
    ID
    name
    description
    metric
    metricType
}

class ReferenceRange {
    minimum
    maximum
}

class TestType {
    internalCode
    nhsCode
    collectionMethodDescription
}

class TestTypeParameter

Administrator "0..*" -- "0..*" Parameter : manages >
Parameter "1" -- "0..1" ReferenceRange : has >
TestType "1" -- "0..*" TestTypeParameter : defines >
TestTypeParameter "0..*" -- "1" Parameter : identifies >

note bottom of ReferenceRange
Numeric: one complete range is required
under team proposal AC11-8.
Qualitative: no numeric range.
minimum <= maximum; finite bounds.
end note

note bottom of TestTypeParameter
Proposed configuration follows catalog registration.
A definition used in a registered test must identify
at least one Parameter (derived use constraint).
Association management is not implemented.
end note

@enduml
